{"base_rate":0.2274436090225564,"brier":0.150296992481203,"bss":0.14464507047917785,"bss_hi":0.3214378665079145,"bss_lo":-0.10814212384235143,"chart":{"base":[356.9,69.9],"fp":[195.7,226.4],"note":{"base":"skill 0.14 — higher than 22% of cities","fp":"low end -0pp, high end +33pp","rel":"promised 6% → rained 2%; promised 98% → rained 71%"},"rel":"102.5,456.5 530,312.3 677.8,160.8"},"country":"NP","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve"],"ece":0.15736842105263157,"ess":233.52202224703743,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Birganj</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Birganj rain forecast is only marginally better than quoting the long-run average, though 4 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (98%), believe about\n<b>71%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(1%), there is still roughly a <b>1%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 532 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-02-01. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 18.6 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.14, ranked 166 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(91&ndash;197) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'><b>1%</b></td><td class='num'>262</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>33%</td><td class='num'><b>9%</b></td><td class='num'>57</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>66%</td><td class='num'><b>36%</b></td><td class='num'>53</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>83%</td><td class='num'><b>35%</b></td><td class='num'>51</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>98%</td><td class='num'><b>71%</b></td><td class='num'>109</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">4 of 5 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Birganj</b> <span class=\"muted\">Nepal</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag bad\">Barely beats the average</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">4 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.14</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>91&ndash;197\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>532 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Birganj &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Birganj\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"60.41854961832061,375.0534351145038 174.19894736842105,222.35087719298247 291.10566037735845,100.41509433962261 351.95882352941175,46.54901960784315 404.04311926605504,18.0 404.04311926605504,38.0366972477064 351.95882352941175,117.921568627451 291.10566037735845,189.69811320754718 174.19894736842105,305.36842105263156 60.41854961832061,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"299.2105263157895\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"299.2105263157895\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"60.41854961832061,379.22137404580155 174.19894736842105,350.0701754385965 291.10566037735845,251.50943396226415 351.95882352941175,253.52941176470588 404.04311926605504,124.86238532110093\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 1% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 262 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"60.41854961832061\" cy=\"379.22137404580155\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 33%&amp;#10;It rained 9% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 57 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"174.19894736842105\" cy=\"350.0701754385965\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 66%&amp;#10;It rained 36% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 53 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"291.10566037735845\" cy=\"251.50943396226415\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 83%&amp;#10;It rained 35% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 51 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"351.95882352941175\" cy=\"253.52941176470588\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 98%&amp;#10;It rained 71% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 109 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"404.04311926605504\" cy=\"124.86238532110093\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(23%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Not enough days in this city's record to split the year into four and still say anything defensible about each part. The split is shown only where it is supported.</p>\n"},"lat":27.01736,"lon":84.88047,"n":532,"n_cities":213,"name":"Birganj","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.12,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.00683206106870229,"n":262,"obs":0.007633587786259542,"sig":false},{"hi":0.5420000000000005,"lo":0.12,"mean":0.32824561403508773,"n":57,"obs":0.08771929824561403,"sig":true},{"hi":0.7570000000000005,"lo":0.5420000000000005,"mean":0.6584905660377357,"n":53,"obs":0.3584905660377358,"sig":true},{"hi":0.92,"lo":0.7570000000000005,"mean":0.830392156862745,"n":51,"obs":0.35294117647058826,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.92,"mean":0.9775229357798165,"n":109,"obs":0.7064220183486238,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":18.6,"provisional":false,"rank":166,"rank_hi":197.0,"rank_lo":91.0,"reliability":0.052076593219408135,"resolution":0.07611267729154675,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"birganj","station":"","timezone":"Asia/Kathmandu"}